  "prefLabel": "Plc 1002.13 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Electricians’ Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1002.13 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Electricians’ Board. The application processing and licensing fees found in Table 1002.13, below, shall apply to the professions regulated by the electricians’ board under RSA 319-C:\n\nTable 1002.13 Application Processing and Licensing Fees for the Professions Regulated by the Electricians’ Board\n\nCategory | License Duration | Fee\n\nElectrician apprentice registration:\n\nInitial or renewal | 12 months | $33\n\nJourneyman electrician license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $110\n\nMaster electrician license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $198\n\nElectrical or high/medium voltage electrical corporation or partnership license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $137\n\nHigh/medium voltage electrician trainee license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial or renewal | 12 months | $66\n\nHigh/medium voltage electrician license application processing and licensing:\n\nInitial, renewal, or reinstatement after expiration of license | 2 years | $198\n\nThird-party electrical inspector license application processing and licensing:\n\nLevel 1 or Level 2 initial or renewal | 2 years | $200\n\nSource. #13703, eff 8-1-23; ss by #14290, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1000.html"
